WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.957
Hope pressed some of Robot's buttons.

2
00:00:10.958 --> 00:00:14.341
Robot did his best claw clicks.

3
00:00:14.342 --> 00:00:17.262
He flashed his lights.

4
00:00:17.263 --> 00:00:21.400
Hope gave him a smile.

5
00:00:21.401 --> 00:00:25.648
She looked closely at his parts and batteries.

6
00:00:25.649 --> 00:00:29.865
"I wonder if she likes me," Robot thought.

7
00:00:29.866 --> 00:00:38.973
But then Hope put Robot down.

8
00:00:38.974 --> 00:00:42.537
She dumped building toys on the floor.

9
00:00:42.538 --> 00:00:49.364
"Grr! She's playing with something else now!" Robot thought.

10
00:00:49.365 --> 00:00:52.321
He watched Hope play for a while.

11
00:00:52.322 --> 00:00:57.584
"Hmph. I'm cooler than those building toys," Robot thought.

12
00:00:57.585 --> 00:01:03.335
He looked up at the MechaTron posters.

13
00:01:03.336 --> 00:01:07.349
He looked at his own claws and lights.

14
00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:13.620
Robot sighed. "But I'm not as cool as MechaTron."

15
00:01:13.621 --> 00:01:16.211
Soon Hope jumped up.

16
00:01:16.212 --> 00:01:19.138
"Come on, Robot!" she said.

17
00:01:19.139 --> 00:01:28.689
"It's time to watch MechaTron

18
00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:32.343
!" Downstairs Hope turned on the

19
00:01:32.344 --> 00:01:34.880
TV. There was

20
00:01:34.881 --> 00:01:47.566
MechaTron! Robot watched MechaTron stop a speeding train.

21
00:01:47.567 --> 00:01:54.034
He punched a huge monster.

22
00:01:54.035 --> 00:01:57.663
He flew and caught a falling woman.

23
00:01:57.664 --> 00:02:01.234
The whole city cheered and clapped.

24
00:02:01.235 --> 00:02:04.184
"Wow," Robot thought.

25
00:02:04.185 --> 00:02:06.511
"No wonder Hope loves MechaTron.

26
00:02:06.512 --> 00:02:11.117
Everyone loves MechaTron!"

27
00:02:11.118 --> 00:02:21.499
Later Hope took Robot back upstairs.

28
00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:25.061
She grabbed a comic book from her bookshelf.

29
00:02:25.062 --> 00:02:28.292
She sat on the bed and opened it.

30
00:02:28.293 --> 00:02:34.354
"This is my favorite MechaTron comic, Robot," Hope said.

31
00:02:34.355 --> 00:02:38.135
"See? MechaTron is fighting a sea monster."

32
00:02:38.136 --> 00:02:41.179
Robot stared at the page.

33
00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:44.392
Hope turned more pages.

34
00:02:44.393 --> 00:02:46.608
"Dan Klee draws this comic.

35
00:02:46.609 --> 00:02:50.450
I wish I could draw like him.

36
00:02:50.451 --> 00:02:52.674
Maybe someday."

37
00:02:52.675 --> 00:02:57.846
Hope held up Dan Klee's picture, but Robot barely looked.

38
00:02:57.847 --> 00:03:00.287
His mind was whirring.

39
00:03:00.288 --> 00:03:04.413
"I'm going to become as cool as MechaTron," he thought.

40
00:03:04.414 --> 00:03:09.747
"I'll find a way!"

